/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 173 0 R
/T (SecureSync implements a defence-in-depth security model, layering multiple independent security controls to protect industrial sensor data throughout its journey from plant to server. The architecture operates on a "default deny" principle, where every request must affirmatively prove its legitimacy through multiple verification stages.)
/E (SecureSync implements a defence-in-depth security model, layering multiple independent security controls to protect industrial sensor data throughout its journey from plant to server. The architecture operates on a "default deny" principle, where every request must affirmatively prove its legitimacy through multiple verification stages.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 173 0 R
/T (The system addresses the fundamental challenge of IoT security: maintaining data confidentiality and integrity whilst ensuring system availability under attack. Through hybrid cryptography, dynamic access controls, and intelligent rate limiting, SecureSync achieves sub-100ms security overhead whilst defending against replay attacks, man-in-the-middle interception, and distributed denial-of-service threats.)
/E (The system addresses the fundamental challenge of IoT security: maintaining data confidentiality and integrity whilst ensuring system availability under attack. Through hybrid cryptography, dynamic access controls, and intelligent rate limiting, SecureSync achieves sub-100ms security overhead whilst defending against replay attacks, man-in-the-middle interception, and distributed denial-of-service threats.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
